From 29b7a8cb74382586e75eb4b90d602be106e0bc36 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mini <mini@local>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 03:37:37 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 02/10] Bundle Objective-C, defer WasmStore creation, and
 pre-parse language configs

Adds tree-sitter-objc grammar and queries served by clangd, avoids
allocating a 16 GB WasmStore per tree-sitter parser when no WASM
grammars are registered, and exposes preload_builtin_configs() so
startup parses built-in TOML configs off the main thread.
